 "title": "ECS-2520MV: 1.6 V to 3.6 V HCMOS crystal oscillator, 0.75 to 160 MHz, 2.5 x 2.0 mm ceramic SMD",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. 2026",
  "pages": 2
 },
 "summary": "A packaged crystal oscillator with a CMOS output that runs from any supply between 1.6 V and 3.6 V, so one part serves 1.8 V, 2.5 V and 3.3 V rails. It sits in a four-pad ceramic body 2.5 mm by 2.0 mm and 0.8 mm high, offered from 0.750 to 160.000 MHz. Pad 1 is a tri-state control: held high or left open the output runs, pulled low the output goes high impedance. ECS-2520MV-250-CN-TR is the 25.000 MHz part with ±25 ppm overall stability over -40 °C to +85 °C, on tape and reel.",
